{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1194,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abbe45882992c777b81e9812",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我说不定能成为可靠的赛马娘呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e40552f1785bf2ce306eabba85712b61ab3a6feba778368d7cb6e8a044ec8c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48af37b61cc1a9c3c77c17c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像我还能够成为大家的力量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96d59a88c70df29b1fad192c682a6f6b3049a12087ed9baf1ca73b6f4e1ac0b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56aba76d0d4049ceaeb0838c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热起来了呢ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e470641cdc27f7eb3ae8881ac7d41bb6d33c8cffffe8bc869e18129e5646145",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4acbe098d5f5a8d1cfd6b6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个开放感…最棒了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "93841ad5a8693ad66a8a5328e6ccc9b0d9062434c5893f3302e454db30d276d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35deff31cb014386589a1a8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把这个夏天，\r\n变成难忘的回忆吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4e0f7de31826785b03f59504752bf236a07adc98e5efd59d0a7fa97ee1ef4e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24470622cfc859da636e03d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是特别周！\r\n我会像盛夏的阳光一样，闪闪发光♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "307ce65770218400df63e86bbbf1630c8d6e8452ca3d6fe1bc5b29bb964300da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a7d4c8119df93ac9b7ea1a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还会继续不断成长的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f53b203cf744efbaf42c8b350b99f66ce76ee4f6273f5f876d0191404e75e4d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e0b8ae52e790dd1f23289ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "超越自己的极限，成为真正的日本第一！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97c1258fefeb081d798b685cbda299d019a64bdf2ab3622887ecb88e73fae6e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7f3d148d137c806a081fa20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将承载着大家梦想的——\r\n日本第一的跑姿传达给所有人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a943440a5c380cbcf1a85810f9295da74b48879835302e2dfe7845aa67606a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02c2f161eebe9210d02e6b9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是特别周，\r\n目标是日本第一！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7b44a73a5f40104affc55e47fc4607d2cf6dde9e82f3a345d19b619498d2b98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75e53acfedd93199ab2abeb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "才不会输……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56891a3fffb316b06e2286c1fbe5382dea197a33e6ed62e8092cc1228a12c699",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9141389ed211eed687f4c7ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果训练员一直对我的奔跑\n心怀信心，那我也能胸怀自信地\n在这条路上奔跑到底。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b191e49e469ecb65fb751074dd9dd8133defa3334904c1b1bb59f08e3ba62108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fae7c4a9b6115919a48bba4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "708d48f999ca231f298df5a3e890f17164021562c4776f58afb4c74b8d84703d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40312d6c6662f0fa1fac2d90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま帰りました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "481ece6b5ae3f39ab09cef14164dcd64ddd6f960e487ca411576688b02f8f52f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cdca5f464d9c8f1a119fd5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和训练员在一起的话，\n不擅长的事情也稍微习惯一些了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "892f30d24216281e72e082ea20cf3036e657b1e095de039b5a35fe90f140f6ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce0bdd8600a2bf5baac6193b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我以前以为，\n只有我一人看见的景色才是最棒的。\n但现在……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dddedf689ed5848434ca5709afd1e7e47b1c6908e3984112c7ccc607b466bf7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b97348c2b51278506d280c51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于来了……！现在正是装饰那棵福来送给我的\n大门松的时候……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05200ac7ca1cd83e7553b4ac04cf1bcd54d59d1ed1250211d92c971ed8922c7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ce507bc32827e4e37496ebf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家吃了好多巧克力……\n吃这么多的话，不会影响比赛吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e73fc420cead20c4bb8fd5ab3118489f8c38ded6ffa417d4f89ddfd88278304",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a8141fad5c5c804dbcd4f47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能请你收下这个吗？\n因为昨天晚上才意识到今天是情人节，\n所以只是一般的松露巧克力……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6c6b882e3596b771fb38c2700b4694cc14b98665d0e0237f0a0f9c416b790d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd9c7fa6bd5d8f9ec6555c0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在星空之下奔跑，真的很有意思。\n不过很容易撞到什么东西，\n必须小心一些……",
      "source_fingerprint": "65647b414d69b9ee2c105d8fbf93e2b5612857567ca49be388c6b0cd30a949a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3233f8b2460de0c809652f2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『不给糖果就捣蛋。\n不给我点心的话我就一直追着你。』\n说是这样说……你觉得怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "49e44c308397e40bb3d9ee177799efecc9624543454fa8db6dfcf9bf29e13e81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b234f869e47b114cdfdb507",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪后的枞树看上去，\n就像是自然装点的圣诞树呢……\n在它旁边跑的话，好像会很舒服的样子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c00f94fbb6cc107ea1802a8d50e9c1db68399e0ee8b717ff4b22a42cb24df0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dc3d58396dc715b9a927e06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去看看圣诞节的灯彩吗？\n像下雪一样忽闪忽闪的，我很喜欢呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b706fd1d1f3627c563aa5b816bdc84120f0fe05558cd87f5b354e102f830b5f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef68ff5af2ab39bd0b73490a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是场不错的比赛呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58ed737834cd61dca095efd33d10ef7afb89ab81d4ef1a462933c44b1bd70bb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47f0e1ac982d3f2b160f960e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为这个时候的和尚们会忙得四处奔走，所以12月才又叫做“师走”对吧。\n稍微有点想看看呢、奔跑着的和尚……",
      "source_fingerprint": "664bff2d7cf1f6187156535ea2a975221d7ab2d6709f17667cf73a86890020f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5ca986b474fd48672e3f274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐。\n就让我把胜利作为礼物送给你吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb494cf0338dcfa4adf5e506e16f76d9bf453f05707fa3584b60b0ca9bbf8f89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c41e9014e6a76ade8dd62b72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好不容易过一次生日，要不要做些难忘的事情？\n去看看只有高处才能看见的风景什么的……\n怎么样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c3b11373fa6166f8107f2586180f315bdc6d468aa544cb0b056bc6c1e3c5a3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a436d1d3b85a6cd2119dcd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，今天是我的生日啊……\n完全沉迷在奔跑之中，\n不小心就忘了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c0cd59a7d50085d540222c0c754d3eac9cd53190b39672e93829780de5ba7dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a54d2e84325289a299b94ed9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "值得回忆的事情变多了，\n难以忘怀的景色也变多了。\n当然，其中也有训练员的身影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfb1237f21fb1485b7714337fcd2f861afd5e5f55c80a0102b9c315f40177ce6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41ed2ac2ab6c061d6fcab4a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新公告。\n要看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "05b332ec397d149d655b0f690e145762a4a0860549ec70c9e2bba3afb0e3b294",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29b8e79b8f2beb72c8d69b07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物呢。\n去看看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6ca8442952d41020630a8a85671f4216c8a75fb9c271e738bd1badbf3d1f89c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83e8595c045a659fa28c8533",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成。\n就这样一鼓作气向前冲吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f505885d2ec2b556c36bd36d16d262d35629c4e9552d84fc4f63cc4d9ebdaca2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96200aa544cc0237316b6e78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动要开始了。\n会是怎样的活动呢……\n……能让我尽情奔跑就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3115801c6c8b4c06eaeb79d30f7796f850e068fa7ba2ecdf8cb990f90ec5ceee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27151138a4d792a37964c2e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经开始了。\n让我也去跑跑吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c085a66e0d452c21e750d15b07697e2dd764c3ac23dd6a9e60bc9dbda7fb1dbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85ef1509ef7342d180fc8908",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次可要赢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f560d585a1ad71f7b33476ea25dcef10be8fdc5a016d29bb4d2451a95fc1e0de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53b046c923f5aabe7447ba34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴的等级好像提升了",
      "source_fingerprint": "eccf2403e15236f859c7d9ef041839222c29ded38ba491e7f1de3364095447a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2f1b051f63708621e5284e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服的颜色，和我奔跑时\r\n所看到的风景色调很像。\r\n光是穿在身上就觉得很舒服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d48787dbf6a1f2ea0bb8f9989d15396310ffc16659870091e38503f9d860970",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d912a055d0b3b35d9b6326c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要气槽看见我的蝴蝶结歪掉，\r\n便会替我重新绑好。\r\n她双手的动作非常漂亮呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fb5e3569a5c3d6e29e955e2f4c6ac8b66fbdec49171fd0706395ea6b7df2e77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e6ba33f3039e10ef34e43f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大树推荐我的那些衣服，\r\n几乎都会把肚脐露在外面……\r\n我很好奇那样肚子会不会着凉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49264accfc2569aa6a40d64dc1e8060e6fee22052c91ece50c3b22396fa32f7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:476b3792f29d941e3cdff3d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0270e97662ad48ab753ebf2c6a2f05315e2ebfb4539514eba9b32967939c361",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1195e8aeaa51e4e628cc3c4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我们的胜利呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08f525ff69b0c7684bdc5edc580113439ef52a4b6ef3af4d240309f3914bf77b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:108885f18831c29425f59c41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次可要赢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f560d585a1ad71f7b33476ea25dcef10be8fdc5a016d29bb4d2451a95fc1e0de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df27e0c5f4e1243aa75938bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0270e97662ad48ab753ebf2c6a2f05315e2ebfb4539514eba9b32967939c361",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91d5834f956493a9d59d7c68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新纪录……！做到了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68818cc9b0b98459fc08c54257e28750c8ea9c581b0ed3dae663d5b8abca90ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d44ddc2c78b56a30e60c1d07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，要加油哦。",
